    "summary": "Pay 2 CP when either player's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) opens. Choose a single unit in your force bearing both **WAR DOG** and **CHARACTER**. Measure 6 inches from the chosen unit for both effects. Require [Battle-shock checks](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock) from every opposing unit in reach. Require [Leadership checks](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls) from all friendly **WAR DOG** units in reach that are already Battle-shocked. Clear Battle-shock for each friendly tester that succeeds. Limit activation to once each turn.",
